### 7B. InventoryRejectedEvent -> CANCELLED

# @name kafkaOrderInventoryRejectPreparePendingOrder
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{$uuid}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "HTTP-MANUAL-ORDER-INVENTORY-REJECT",
