### ============================================================================
### 10. Catálogo cubierto
### ============================================================================
# Endpoints HTTP: 4/4.
# Mensajes Kafka: 10/10.
#   ReserveInventoryCommand, ReleaseInventoryCommand,
#   InventoryReservedEvent, InventoryRejectedEvent, InventoryReleasedEvent,
#   AuthorizePaymentCommand, PaymentAuthorizedEvent, PaymentRejectedEvent,
#   OrderConfirmedEvent, OrderCancelledEvent.
#
# Los fixtures de referencia del repositorio están en docs/messaging/contracts/*.json.
